er border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-lg shadow-lg py-2 min-w-[180px] z-50\"><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">Lawn Care</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/landscaping\">Landscaping</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/pest-control\">Pest Control</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/tree-care\">Tree Care</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/gardening\">Gardening</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/home-garden\">Home &amp; Garden</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/grass-types\">Grass Types</a></div></div><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/authors\">Authors</a><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About</a></nav><button class=\"md:hidden p-2 rounded-md hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-6 mb-10\"><div class=\"relative w-24 h-24 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-[var(--color-muted)]\"><img alt=\"Sarah Chen\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ac1c13882bd7e4bb4abae94ddc9bddffdj.jpg\"/></div><div><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">Sarah Chen</h1><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] max-w-xl\">Registered Horticulturist (ASHS) and landscape architect with 18 years of practice. Earned her M.S. in Horticultural Science from UC Davis with research focus on native plant ecology. Led the award-winning Urban Meadows Initiative in Portland, converting 40+ acres of traditional turf to pollinator-friendly native landscapes. Author of The Pacific Northwest Native Garden (Timber Press, 2021). Board member of the Native Plant Society and frequent keynote speaker at regional horticulture conferences.</p></div></div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6\">Articles by <!-- -->Sarah Chen</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/organic-lawn-care-dayton-ohio\"><img alt=\"Organic Lawn Care in Dayton, Ohio: A Complete Guide to a Greener, Healthier Yard\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ac3fd5802ff1c4abf85f531904ee244eao.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">Lawn Care</a><a href=\"/blog/organic-lawn-care-dayton-ohio\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Organic Lawn Care in Dayton, Ohio: A Complete Guide to a Greener, Healthier Yard</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Master organic lawn care in Dayton, Ohio with expert tips on soil health, natural fertilizers, weed control, and seasonal maintenance for a thriving lawn.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Sarah Chen</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-30 00:21:29\">Aug 30, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/lawn-care-tips-spring\"><img alt=\"Spring Lawn Care Tips: A Complete Guide to a Healthier, Greener Lawn\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A7a73fa7e9de34664979524f6f7b1d3b9N.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">Lawn Care</a><a href=\"/blog/lawn-care-tips-spring\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Spring Lawn Care Tips: A Complete Guide to a Healthier, Greener Lawn</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Discover essential spring lawn care tips to revive your yard after winter. Learn when to mow, fertilize, aerate, and treat weeds for a lush, healthy lawn.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Sarah Chen</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-27 00:23:30\">Aug 27, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/regional-hedge-trimming-schedule-climate-zones\"><img alt=\"Regional Hedge Trimming Schedule: When to Prune by Climate\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A2ec26102cf0e42b48db205f070474101k.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/tree-care\">Tree Care</a><a href=\"/blog/regional-hedge-trimming-schedule-climate-zones\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Regional Hedge Trimming Schedule: When to Prune by Climate</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Master your regional hedge trimming schedule with our climate-zone guide. Learn exact pruning times, species rules, and tool specs for healthy shrubs.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Sarah Chen</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-25 02:16:10\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a clas