fcefad5e4d77b44ef3cbd668cb93i.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/tree-care\">Tree Care</a><a href=\"/blog/how-to-cut-tree-branches-three-cut-method\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">How to Cut Tree Branches: The 3-Cut Pruning Method Guide</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Learn how to cut tree branches safely using the 3-cut pruning method. Protect your trees from decay with proper tool selection and exact cut placement.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Sarah Chen</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-25 02:16:10\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/can-you-eat-dogwood-berries-foraging-guide\"><img alt=\"Can You Eat Dogwood Berries? A Complete Foraging &amp; ID Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Aa584194c01004dce96197d1e4228a2f8W.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/tree-care\">Tree Care</a><a href=\"/blog/can-you-eat-dogwood-berries-foraging-guide\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Can You Eat Dogwood Berries? A Complete Foraging &amp; ID Guide</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Discover if you can eat dogwood berries. Learn to identify edible Kousa and Cornelian cherry species versus toxic flowering dogwood fruits.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Sarah Chen</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-25 02:16:10\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/az-palm-trees-desert-planting-care-guide\"><img alt=\"How to Plant and Maintain AZ Palm Trees in Extreme Desert Heat\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A7200420ba30549d897a36bcaba36f53bT.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/tree-care\">Tree Care</a><a href=\"/blog/az-palm-trees-desert-planting-care-guide\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">How to Plant and Maintain AZ Palm Trees in Extreme Desert Heat</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Master AZ palm tree care with our desert-specific planting guide. Learn caliche soil prep, monsoon staking, and frost protection for Southwest landscapes.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Sarah Chen</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-25 02:16:09\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex